# One pattern per line, matched case-insensitively against Image Path or
# Launch String. * and ? are wildcards. Copy to unsigned_ignore.txt (next to
# autoruns.sqlite) and edit. Ignored entries are hidden by default and come back
# with the "Show ignored" switch on the page.
#
# Prefer one line per specific file. A folder wildcard such as
# c:\program files\7-zip\* also hides anything unsigned that is dropped into
# that folder later, which is the case this page exists to catch.
#
# c:\tools\my-inhouse-script.exe
# c:\program files\7-zip\7z.dll
